  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">使用此模组，你可以坐在任何你想到达的位置。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">只需按下 V 键即可（默认为 V 键，可在按键绑定设置中更改）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">然后坐下。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">要站起来，只需蹲下、跳跃、移动或再次按下 V 键即可。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">支持多人游戏。（服务器也需要安装此模组！）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">你可以在配置文件中更改模型部件的旋转值。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">（但这些设置不同步，以防止作弊或错误）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">模组目前支持：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Forge&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 26.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.5 | 1.21.1 | 1.20.1</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Fabric:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 26.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.5 | 1.21.1 | 1.20.1</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Neoforge: 26.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.1</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1326/10/638862046872939689.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"436\" height=\"436\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f60\"><strong>如果你需要其他版本的模组或在 CurseForge 上遇到任何错误，请给我发送私信</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f60\"><a style=\"color:#f60\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#00f\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#00f\"><strong>在 X (Twitter) 上关注我</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://x.com/Aquarius_playz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://x.com/Aquarius_playz</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1577/494/639022024300181764.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><a style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>此模组需要安装 AQUARIUSLIBS</strong></a></span></p>",
